# Line endings: LF everywhere, also in Windows checkouts. The pre-commit hook and the install scripts are
# shell scripts (a CRLF breaks them), and `npm run cases:check` compares generated text byte for byte.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary assets: never diff or convert
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.onnx binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
